BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Heat (1995)
DTSTART:20251016T023000Z
DTEND:20251016T054000Z
DTSTAMP:20251016T023000Z
UID:LIJnhMobIw
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 170 mins (2h50m)\n\nL.A. Noir: Shadows in Paradise P
 resented by Greg Olson Productions Two men in L.A. A criminal\, a cop. Rob
 ert De Niro and Al Pacino. Fire and ice\, coming to a boil. Cool and contr
 olled\, De Niro and his pals (Val Kilmer\, Jon Voight\, Tom Sizemore) pull
  off big robberies with military precision. Steamed-up\, swaggering Pacino
  uses intuition and massive manpower to track them\, with limited success.
  Master stylist Michael Mann (TV’s "Miami Vice") gives this monumental c
 rime saga irresistible forward momentum\, but everything stops so two grea
 t American actors\, De Niro and Pacino\, can appear together for the first
  time and have coffee. The outlaw and the lawman are both doing what they
 ’re best at\, and it’s their nature to keep on with it. But for a mome
 nt out of time they talk about the fullness and emptiness of their lives\,
  what they gain and lose. This isn’t a truce\, there will be machine gun
  fire on downtown streets\, people lying dead. They’ll meet again at nig
 ht\, out in a field at the airport. Planes glide overhead like souls\, som
 e coming in\, some leaving on the soft\, sultry air. 30th Anniversary Scre
 ening. Individual Tickets: $15Passes: Prorated\, with discounts for SIFF\,
  SAM\, Swedish Club\, UW Cinema Studies\, NWFF\, SFI\, TheFilmSchool\, Fes
 ta Italiana\, Alliance Francaise de Seattle\, Scarecrow Video\, & KING FM 
 members\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/la-noir-shadows-in-para
 dise/heat-30th-anniversary
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
